  "idea": "Automated password and 2FA credential sharing hub for remote teams",
  "text": "Stop sharing company login passwords over unencrypted Slack messages. Remote contractors constantly drop plain-text credentials and authenticator codes into public channels to unblock urgent tasks. Without centralized access controls, offboarded staff retain permanent entry to your client billing portals and analytics. Implementing a 1Password Teams vault automates credential distribution with zero-knowledge encryption and biometric permissions. This eliminates security breaches while granting instant access.",
